---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { person } from '../config/site';

const lastUpdated = 'October 10, 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How aaronjaylev.com collects, uses, and protects information about visitors.">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-400 mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Overview</h2>
				<p>
					This policy explains what information is collected when you visit aaronjaylev.com (the "Site"), how it is used, and the choices you have. The Site is a personal resume and portfolio operated by {person.name}. It has no user accounts and no contact forms.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li><strong class="text-slate-100">Analytics data.</strong> Google Analytics records information such as the pages you view, how long you stay, the page that referred you, your browser and device type, and an approximate location derived from your IP address.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-slate-100">Email correspondence.</strong> If you email me, I receive your address and whatever you include in the message.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4">The Site does not collect payment information, and it does not ask you to create an account or submit personal details.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">How We Use Information</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li>To understand how visitors use the Site so it can be improved.</li>
					<li>To reply to messages you send me about my work or opportunities.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4">I do not sell your information, and I do not use it for advertising.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
				<p>
					The Site uses Google Analytics (Google tag ID G-6H8RKFXRHP) to measure traffic. Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to tell visitors apart. You can limit or delete these cookies through your browser settings. You can also opt out of Google Analytics entirely by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4">
					To learn how Google handles the data it collects, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li><strong class="text-slate-100">Google Analytics</strong> and <strong class="text-slate-100">Google Fonts</strong>. Fonts are loaded from Google's servers, so your IP address is sent to Google when the page loads.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-slate-100">Hosting provider.</strong> The Site is hosted on a web hosting service that keeps standard server logs, which may include IP addresses.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-slate-100">External links.</strong> The Site links to LinkedIn, X, GitHub, and other websites. Those sites have their own privacy policies, which I do not control.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Data Retention</h2>
				<p>
					Analytics data is kept according to the retention settings in Google Analytics. Emails are kept only as long as needed to respond to you and to maintain our correspondence.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Your Choices and Rights</h2>
				<p>
					You can disable cookies, use the Google Analytics opt-out add-on, or stop visiting the Site at any time. Depending on where you live, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information I hold about you. To make a request, email me at the address below.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
				<p>The Site is not directed to children under 13, and I do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
				<p>
					I may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it was last changed.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-3">Contact</h2>
				<p>
					Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${person.email}`} class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 transition">{person.email}</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
